ADDTEAM TeamA
ADDTEAM TeamB
START DURATION 100 PROBLEM 3
SUBMIT A BY TeamA WITH Accepted AT 10
SUBMIT B BY TeamA WITH Accepted AT 20
SUBMIT A BY TeamB WITH Accepted AT 15
SUBMIT C BY TeamB WITH Accepted AT 25
FLUSH
FREEZE
SUBMIT B BY TeamA WITH Wrong_Answer AT 30
SUBMIT C BY TeamB WITH Wrong_Answer AT 35
SCROLL
END